{"id": "en_thin_ice_p1", "total": 65.51, "segments": [{"text": "If you fall through lake ice, do not start swimming toward the nearest dry bank.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.38}, {"text": "Mark steps onto the frozen lake, unaware he has only 10 minutes to save himself.", "start": 3.88, "end": 7.4}, {"text": "Suddenly, a loud crack echoes, and the freezing water swallows Mark under the dark ice.", "start": 7.86, "end": 11.56}, {"text": "Cold shock strikes immediately, leaving him just 1 minute to control his heavy, gasping breathing.", "start": 11.98, "end": 16.14}, {"text": "He remembers the 1-10-1 rule before cold water robs his body of all muscle control.", "start": 16.58, "end": 20.66}, {"text": "One. Turn back around toward the exact direction you just walked from right away.", "start": 20.330000000000002, "end": 24.68}, {"text": "That specific path of ice already proved it can hold your full body weight safely.", "start": 24.96, "end": 28.0}, {"text": "Two. Place your arms flat on the solid ice surface and kick your legs hard.", "start": 27.918, "end": 31.64}, {"text": "Get your body completely horizontal in the water, then pull your chest up onto ice.", "start": 32.04, "end": 35.36}, {"text": "Three. Do not stand up once your body climbs out onto the slippery surface.", "start": 35.382, "end": 38.98}, {"text": "Instead, Mark crouches low and rolls away from the hole to spread his body weight.", "start": 39.36, "end": 42.78}, {"text": "Rolling across the thin ice prevents a second break while keeping him out of water.", "start": 43.22, "end": 46.34}, {"text": "Mark begins crawling carefully toward the tree-lined shore to reach safety and warm shelter.", "start": 46.88, "end": 50.42}, {"text": "He follows every safety step correctly to escape the freezing lake in record time.", "start": 50.88, "end": 54.08}, {"text": "It was the perfect escape plan, but there was just one major problem remaining.", "start": 54.46, "end": 57.78}, {"text": "Wet clothes freeze instantl